name tlcockpit
category Package
revision 54857
shortdesc A GUI frontend to TeX Live Manager (tlmgr)
longdesc This package aims at being a GUI for tlmgr, the TeX Live
longdesc Manager, with a modern look and feel. We take inspiration from
longdesc the excellent TeX Live Utility for MacOS.
